From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: k114s-integration <integration@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:39:46 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] tests: display host stub: add V27_3B

The T6050 hand-off in src/kboot_display_handoff.c compares the OS firmware
with V27_3B since betizzel/omarchy-m5's aura patch 0001 ("kboot: T6050:
hand the GPU and the internal display over on 27.3 beta 1"). The host
test's stand-in for src/firmware.h does not have it, so
tests/run-t8122-display-handoff.sh stopped compiling on that series:

  kboot_display_handoff.c: error: 'V27_3B' undeclared here

Add it to the stub. Test-only: nothing in the loader binary changes.

K114s integration (chrisohearn/omarchy-m5p-oled).
---
 tests/t8122_display_host/firmware.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/tests/t8122_display_host/firmware.h b/tests/t8122_display_host/firmware.h
index a8dd1517..8afa6024 100644
--- a/tests/t8122_display_host/firmware.h
+++ b/tests/t8122_display_host/firmware.h
@@ -13,6 +13,7 @@ enum fw_version {
     V26_7 = 103,
     V27_0 = 104,
     V27_2 = 105,
+    V27_3B = 106,
 };
 struct fw_version_info {
     enum fw_version version;
